# Navigation pending UI

When the user changes screen (nav link, bottom tab, org/branch context), show a waiting state like Platform. Silent freezes feel like the app crashed.

## Do

- Show a top progress bar immediately; after ~320ms show the centered GS waiting card (“กำลังเปิดหน้าถัดไป” / “กำลังเปลี่ยนบริบท” + “โปรดรอสักครู่…”)
- Customer embed shell owns the overlay when present; HR `NavigationPending` signals `gs:navigation-done` on route change
- Soft navigation: clear pending when the route (pathname/search) changes
- For context or soft-nav triggers from product code: `signalNavigationPending()` / `signalNavigationDone()`

## Do not

- Rely only on tiny inline text with no overlay
- Leave the previous screen looking frozen with no feedback
- Stack a second overlay on top of the Customer App shell pending UI
